menu "ESP32 AI Builder Example Configuration"

    config BLINK_GPIO
        int "Blink GPIO number"
        range 0 48
        default 2
        help
            GPIO number (IOxx) toggled by the hello_world example.
            ESP32-S3-DevKitC-1 with an addressable RGB LED usually uses IO48 or IO38;
            simple on/off LEDs are wired per-board (2 is a common choice).

endmenu
